{"step_index":364,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-02T08:25:22Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-02T12:25:22+04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-02T12:25:22+04:00\nFile Path: `file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/files/ns1-hooks/acme-zone-update.sh`\nTotal Lines: 110\nTotal Bytes: 4135\nShowing lines 50 to 75\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n50: \n51: # --- Garde-fou 2 : sauvegarde automatique avant toute modification ---\n52: backup=\"${zonefile}.bak.$(date +%Y%m%d%H%M%S)\"\n53: cp \"$zonefile\" \"$backup\"\n54: \n55: tmpfile=\"${zonefile}.acme.tmp.$$\"\n56: \n57: # Retirer toute ligne existante dont le premier champ correspond exactement\n58: # au label (évite les doublons/résidus d'une précédente émission).\n59: awk -v label=\"$label\" '$1 != label' \"$zonefile\" > \"$tmpfile\"\n60: \n61: if [ \"$action\" = \"add\" ]; then\n62:   if [ -z \"$value\" ]; then\n63:     echo \"add nécessite une valeur\" >&2\n64:     rm -f \"$tmpfile\"\n65:     exit 2\n66:   fi\n67:   printf '%s\\t60\\tTXT\\t\"%s\"\\n' \"$label\" \"$value\" >> \"$tmpfile\"\n68: fi\n69: \n70: # Faire avancer le serial SOA (format YYYYMMDDNN observé dans ce fichier).\n71: today=$(date +%Y%m%d)\n72: case \"$current_serial\" in\n73:   \"${today}\"*)\n74:     rev=$(echo \"$current_serial\" | cut -c9-10)\n75:     new_rev=$(printf '%02d' $((10#$rev + 1)))\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
{"step_index":365,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-02T08:25:22Z","thinking":"Determining the relative label and absolute FQDN with a trailing dot is crucial to prevent the zone record from being affected by any intervening `$ORIGIN` directives within the zone file. The objective is to construct the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) by removing the base zone name from the initial label. Now, the existing lines within the zone must be removed.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Ensure ACME challenge records use absolute FQDN with trailing dot to ignore any $ORIGIN directives\"","EndLine":"69","Instruction":"\"Compute relative label and FQDN, filter both in awk, and write FQDN with trailing dot\"","ReplacementContent":"\"# Calculer le label relatif et le FQDN absolu (avec point final) pour\\n# immuniser l'enregistrement contre toute directive $ORIGIN intermédiaire\\n# dans le fichier de zone (ex. $ORIGIN private.sfrcaraibe.fr. dans sfrcaraibe.fr).\\nlabel_rel=\\\"${label%.${zonename}.}\\\"\\nlabel_rel=\\\"${label_rel%.}\\\"\\nfqdn=\\\"${label_rel}.${zonename}.\\\"\\n\\n# Retirer toute ligne existante dont le premier champ correspond au label\\n# relatif ou au FQDN absolu (évite les doublons/résidus).\\nawk -v rel=\\\"$label_rel\\\" -v fqdn=\\\"$fqdn\\\" '$1 != rel && $1 != fqdn' \\\"$zonefile\\\" > \\\"$tmpfile\\\"\\n\\nif [ \\\"$action\\\" = \\\"add\\\" ]; then\\n  if [ -z \\\"$value\\\" ]; then\\n    echo \\\"add nécessite une valeur\\\" >&2\\n    rm -f \\\"$tmpfile\\\"\\n    exit 2\\n  fi\\n  printf '%s\\\\t60\\\\tTXT\\\\t\\\"%s\\\"\\\\n' \\\"$fqdn\\\" \\\"$value\\\" >> \\\"$tmpfile\\\"\\nfi\"","StartLine":"56","TargetContent":"\"# Retirer toute ligne existante dont le premier champ correspond exactement\\n# au label (évite les doublons/résidus d'une précédente émission).\\nawk -v label=\\\"$label\\\" '$1 != label' \\\"$zonefile\\\" > \\\"$tmpfile\\\"\\n\\nif [ \\\"$action\\\" = \\\"add\\\" ]; then\\n  if [ -z \\\"$value\\\" ]; then\\n    echo \\\"add nécessite une valeur\\\" >&2\\n    rm -f \\\"$tmpfile\\\"\\n    exit 2\\n  fi\\n  printf '%s\\\\t60\\\\tTXT\\\\t\\\"%s\\\"\\\\n' \\\"$label\\\" \\\"$value\\\" >> \\\"$tmpfile\\\"\\nfi\"","TargetFile":"\"/home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/files/ns1-hooks/acme-zone-update.sh\"","toolAction":"\"Updating acme-zone-update.sh\"","toolSummary":"\"Updating acme-zone-update.sh with FQDN support\""}}]}
{"step_index":366,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-02T08:25:30Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-02T12:25:30+04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-02T12:25:36+04:00\nThe following changes were made by the replace_file_content tool to: /home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/files/ns1-hooks/acme-zone-update.sh. If relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission.\n[diff_block_start]\n@@ -54,9 +54,16 @@\n \n tmpfile=\"${zonefile}.acme.tmp.$$\"\n \n-# Retirer toute ligne existante dont le premier champ correspond exactement\n-# au label (évite les doublons/résidus d'une précédente émission).\n-awk -v label=\"$label\" '$1 != label' \"$zonefile\" > \"$tmpfile\"\n+# Calculer le label relatif et le FQDN absolu (avec point final) pour\n+# immuniser l'enregistrement contre toute directive $ORIGIN intermédiaire\n+# dans le fichier de zone (ex. $ORIGIN private.sfrcaraibe.fr. dans sfrcaraibe.fr).\n+label_rel=\"${label%.${zonename}.}\"\n+label_rel=\"${label_rel%.}\"\n+fqdn=\"${label_rel}.${zonename}.\"\n+\n+# Retirer toute ligne existante dont le premier champ correspond au label\n+# relatif ou au FQDN absolu (évite les doublons/résidus).\n+awk -v rel=\"$label_rel\" -v fqdn=\"$fqdn\" '$1 != rel && $1 != fqdn' \"$zonefile\" > \"$tmpfile\"\n \n if [ \"$action\" = \"add\" ]; then\n   if [ -z \"$value\" ]; then\n@@ -63,7 +63,7 @@\n     rm -f \"$tmpfile\"\n     exit 2\n   fi\n-  printf '%s\\t60\\tTXT\\t\"%s\"\\n' \"$label\" \"$value\" >> \"$tmpfile\"\n+  printf '%s\\t60\\tTXT\\t\"%s\"\\n' \"$fqdn\" \"$value\" >> \"$tmpfile\"\n fi\n \n # Faire avancer le serial SOA (format YYYYMMDDNN observé dans ce fichier).\n[diff_block_end]\n\nPlease note that the above snippet only shows the MODIFIED lines from the last change. It shows up to 3 lines of unchanged lines before and after the modified lines. The actual file contents may have many more lines not shown."}
