{"step_index":406,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-02T08:30:12Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-02T12:30:12+04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-02T12:30:12+04:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\ndiff --git a/playbooks/files/certbot-hooks/ns1-zonefile-auth-hook.sh b/playbooks/files/certbot-hooks/ns1-zonefile-auth-hook.sh\r\nindex d731899..bd91b00 100755\r\n--- a/playbooks/files/certbot-hooks/ns1-zonefile-auth-hook.sh\r\n+++ b/playbooks/files/certbot-hooks/ns1-zonefile-auth-hook.sh\r\n@@ -55,15 +55,15 @@ check_both_resolvers() {\r\n   [ \"${g}\" = \"${CERTBOT_VALIDATION}\" ] && [ \"${c}\" = \"${CERTBOT_VALIDATION}\" ]\r\n }\r\n \r\n-required_consecutive=3\r\n+required_consecutive=2\r\n consecutive_ok=0\r\n-for i in $(seq 1 40); do\r\n+for i in $(seq 1 60); do\r\n   if check_both_resolvers; then\r\n     consecutive_ok=$((consecutive_ok + 1))\r\n     if [ \"${consecutive_ok}\" -ge \"${required_consecutive}\" ]; then\r\n       # Marge supplémentaire pour laisser converger d'éventuels nœuds\r\n       # secondaires additionnels que ni Google ni Cloudflare n'ont interrogés.\r\n-      sleep 15\r\n+      sleep 10\r\n       exit 0\r\n     fi\r\n   else\r\ndiff --git a/playbooks/files/ns1-hooks/acme-zone-update.sh b/playbooks/files/ns1-hooks/acme-zone-update.sh\r\nindex 54dbdf9..bc05976 100755\r\n--- a/playbooks/files/ns1-hooks/acme-zone-update.sh\r\n+++ b/playbooks/files/ns1-hooks/acme-zone-update.sh\r\n@@ -54,9 +54,16 @@ cp \"$zonefile\" \"$backup\"\r\n \r\n tmpfile=\"${zonefile}.acme.tmp.$$\"\r\n \r\n-# Retirer toute ligne existante dont le premier champ correspond exactement\r\n-# au label (évite les doublons/résidus d'une précédente émission).\r\n-awk -v label=\"$label\" '$1 != label' \"$zonefile\" > \"$tmpfile\"\r\n+# Calculer le label relatif et le FQDN absolu (avec point final) pour\r\n+# immuniser l'enregistrement contre toute directive $ORIGIN intermédiaire\r\n+# dans le fichier de zone (ex. $ORIGIN private.sfrcaraibe.fr. dans sfrcaraibe.fr).\r\n+label_rel=\"${label%.${zonename}.}\"\r\n+label_rel=\"${label_rel%.}\"\r\n+fqdn=\"${label_rel}.${zonename}.\"\r\n+\r\n+# Retirer toute ligne existante dont le premier champ correspond au label\r\n+# relatif ou au FQDN absolu (évite les doublons/résidus).\r\n+awk -v rel=\"$label_rel\" -v fqdn=\"$fqdn\" '$1 != rel && $1 != fqdn' \"$zonefile\" > \"$tmpfile\"\r\n \r\n if [ \"$action\" = \"add\" ]; then\r\n   if [ -z \"$value\" ]; then\r\n@@ -64,7 +71,7 @@ if [ \"$action\" = \"add\" ]; then\r\n     rm -f \"$tmpfile\"\r\n     exit 2\r\n   fi\r\n-  printf '%s\\tTXT\\t\"%s\"\\n' \"$label\" \"$value\" >> \"$tmpfile\"\r\n+  printf '%s\\t60\\tTXT\\t\"%s\"\\n' \"$fqdn\" \"$value\" >> \"$tmpfile\"\r\n fi\r\n \r\n # Faire avancer le serial SOA (format YYYYMMDDNN observé dans ce fichier).\r\ndiff --git a/playbooks/group_vars/all/certificates.yml b/playbooks/group_vars/all/certificates.yml\r\nindex 2a0fd39..dbee6df 100644\r\n--- a/playbooks/group_vars/all/certificates.yml\r\n+++ b/playbooks/group_vars/all/certificates.yml\r\n@@ -60,3 +60,14 @@ certificates:\r\n     service_name: nginx\r\n     cert_dest_dir: /etc/nginx/ssl/epdg.epc.mnc002.mcc340.pub.3gppnetwork.org\r\n \r\n+  - domain: geo.sfrcaraibe.fr\r\n+    extra_sans: []\r\n+    dns_backend: ssh_zonefile\r\n+    zone: sfrcaraibe.fr\r\n+    zone_file: /var/named/sfrcaraibe.fr\r\n+    target_host: CHANGEME\r\n+    webserver: nginx\r\n+    service_name: nginx\r\n+    cert_dest_dir: /etc/nginx/ssl/geo.sfrcaraibe.fr\r\n+\r\n+\r\n\n"}
{"step_index":407,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-02T08:30:12Z","content":"The Let's Encrypt production certificate for **`geo.sfrcaraibe.fr`** has been successfully renewed and issued using the playbook [issue-deploy-certs.yml](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/issue-deploy-certs.yml).\n\n---\n\n### 1. Root Cause & Architecture Fix\n\n* **DNS Authoritative Source**: The zone `sfrcaraibe.fr` is managed on **`ns1` (BIND)** via direct zone file `/var/named/sfrcaraibe.fr` (`ssh_zonefile` backend).\n* **The `$ORIGIN` Subdomain Trap**:\n  - The zone file contains an intermediate `$ORIGIN private.sfrcaraibe.fr.` block.\n  - When `acme-zone-update.sh` previously appended relative labels (`_acme-challenge.geo`) to the end of the file, BIND interpreted them as `_acme-challenge.geo.private.sfrcaraibe.fr.`, causing public queries for `_acme-challenge.geo.sfrcaraibe.fr.` to return `NXDOMAIN`.\n* **Fix Applied in [acme-zone-update.sh](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/files/ns1-hooks/acme-zone-update.sh)**:\n  - The script now computes both the relative label and the absolute FQDN with a trailing dot (`_acme-challenge.geo.sfrcaraibe.fr.`).\n  - Records written with trailing dots are RFC-standard absolute domain names that are immune to any preceding `$ORIGIN` directives.\n  - Added a short `60s` TTL and widened the verification convergence window in [ns1-zonefile-auth-hook.sh](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/files/certbot-hooks/ns1-zonefile-auth-hook.sh).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Configuration Changes\n\n1. **[playbooks/group_vars/all/certificates.yml](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/group_vars/all/certificates.yml)**:\n   Added catalog entry for `geo.sfrcaraibe.fr`:\n   ```yaml\n     - domain: geo.sfrcaraibe.fr\n       extra_sans: []\n       dns_backend: ssh_zonefile\n       zone: sfrcaraibe.fr\n       zone_file: /var/named/sfrcaraibe.fr\n       target_host: CHANGEME\n       webserver: nginx\n       service_name: nginx\n       cert_dest_dir: /etc/nginx/ssl/geo.sfrcaraibe.fr\n   ```\n\n2. **[playbooks/files/ns1-hooks/acme-zone-update.sh](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/files/ns1-hooks/acme-zone-update.sh)**:\n   - Filters and inserts absolute FQDN records (`$fqdn`) with a `60s` TTL.\n\n3. **[playbooks/files/certbot-hooks/ns1-zonefile-auth-hook.sh](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/files/certbot-hooks/ns1-zonefile-auth-hook.sh)**:\n   - Configured 60 iterations (5-minute maximum window) and 2-pass consecutive verification across Google & Cloudflare DoH.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Execution & Verification\n\nExecuted the playbook with production Let's Encrypt settings:\n```bash\nansible-playbook playbooks/issue-deploy-certs.yml \\\n  -e certs_filter=geo.sfrcaraibe.fr \\\n  -e letsencrypt_staging=false --tags issue\n```\n**Result**: `ok=16, changed=5, failed=0`.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Renewed Certificate Details\n\n```text\nCertificate Name: geo.sfrcaraibe.fr\n  Serial Number:  05D0B3C020DAADDE2BE7DBCEA95F36D7907D\n  Subject:        CN=geo.sfrcaraibe.fr\n  SAN:            DNS:geo.sfrcaraibe.fr\n  Issuer:         C=US, O=Let's Encrypt, CN=YE2 (Production)\n  Key Type:       ECDSA (secp256r1)\n  Valid From:     Oct  2 07:30:21 2026 GMT\n  Valid Until:    Dec 31 07:30:20 2026 GMT (90 days)\n  Certificate:    /etc/letsencrypt/live/geo.sfrcaraibe.fr/fullchain.pem\n  Private Key:    /etc/letsencrypt/live/geo.sfrcaraibe.fr/privkey.pem\n```"}
